"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The Russian defense ministry announced that it targeted logistics hubs and supply centers in Kyiv and the surrounding areas. Facilities operated by Russia's largest online retailer were also affected in St Petersburg and Tver.\",            \"english_title\": \"Russian Targets\",            \"translated_version\": \"El ministerio de defensa ruso dijo que atac\u00f3 centros de log\u00edstica y suministros en Kyiv y \u00e1reas cercanas. Tambi\u00e9n se afectaron lugares de la tienda en l\u00ednea m\u00e1s grande de Rusia en San Petersburgo y Tver.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Objetivos Rusos\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"US Secretary of State Marco Rubio and Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent stated that discussions have advanced to allow shipments to resume.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Discussions\",            \"translated_version\": \"El Secretario de Estado de EE.UU. Marco Rubio y el Secretario del Tesoro Scott Bessent dijeron que las conversaciones han avanzado para permitir que los env\u00edos contin\u00faen.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Conversaciones de EE.UU.\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"About 70,000 of the 72,000 people who entered Ceuta illegally last week have been sent back to Morocco, according to Spain.\",            \"english_title\": \"Ceuta Returns\",            \"translated_version\": \"Unos 70,000 de los 72,000 que entraron a Ceuta ilegalmente la semana pasada han sido devueltos a Marruecos, seg\u00fan Espa\u00f1a.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Devoluciones en Ceuta\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Egyptian authorities claim that a scam involved fake scenes in court as part of a scheme to cheat people.\",            \"english_title\": \"Egyptian Scam\",            \"translated_version\": \"Las autoridades egipcias dicen que una estafa us\u00f3 escenas falsas en la corte como 